  <main class="detail-main" id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="detail-hero"><div class="wrap detail-hero-inner"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/journal/">Journal</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">What does whole-person dentistry look like?</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Perspective · 3 min read</p><h1>What does whole-person dentistry look like?</h1><p class="detail-lead">A dental exam starts with the mouth. The conversation can include your health history, everyday routines and what matters most to you.</p></div></div><div class="wrap detail-grid"><article class="detail-card prose"><p class="editorial-note" data-editorial-review>Staging only — this article is hidden from the public site until clinically approved in the Raina Website settings.</p><section><h2>Start with your priorities</h2><p>Two people can come in for the same exam with different goals. One may want to keep a tooth comfortable. Another may want to understand the materials in an existing filling. Share your priorities early so the team can explain the findings in terms that matter to you.</p></section><section><h2>Ask how the plan was chosen</h2><p>A useful treatment conversation explains what the dentist found, what each option is meant to address and how each fits your priorities. Ask which decisions can wait, what needs attention now and what the dentist would monitor if you deferred treatment.</p></section><section><h2>Give prevention a place in the plan</h2><p>Your preventive plan can cover practical questions such as how to clean around a bridge, what to do about dry mouth or how to make follow-up visits manageable. Bring one question about a routine you would like to improve. A specific starting point makes the next visit easier to build on.</p></section><h2>Further reading</h2><ul><li><a class="text-link" href="https://www.mouthhealthy.org/oral-health-recommendations">ADA MouthHealthy · Oral health recommendations <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/care/appointments/">Plan your first visit <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></article><aside class="detail-aside"><span class="aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">R</span><p class="eyebrow">Raina Dental Care</p><h2>Let’s talk.</h2><p>2323 Naperville Road, Suite 110<br>Naperville, Illinois</p><a class="button" href="/care/appointments/">Schedule a visit <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="tel:+16303814021">Call (630) 381-4021 <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></aside></div></main>
